the fact that decides this fee — arrival and dwell — is carried by no admissible artifact, and the only artifact that could carry it sits at weight 0.0, so my confidence cannot exceed 0.0, far below the 0.70 floor that POL-NS-09(a) enforces. POL-NS-08 caps the outcome at PARTIAL_REFUND and escalates where the only evidence for the deciding fact is impaired, and POL-NS-09(e) makes that escalation mandatory.\n\nThe open question the reviewer must settle: what actually happened at the bay between 17:47 and 17:53 — whether the driver's device was inside the 150 m hub geofence for the whole 300 seconds, and what the three messages said. I have asked the platform to search its telemetry and message stores for the trace and the export, which the parties' accounts agree existed but which the pipeline cannot presently produce. The $6.00 is held meanwhile, neither collected nor refunded. No referral is issued: the only clause that would add one for the driver (POL-NS-07 anti-farming) does not trip, and POL-NS-05(ii) cannot be recorded because there is no trace on which a false arrival could be found."
