ee ($4.00), so POL-NS-08(d) is not engaged. The reason this case cannot be decided is the missing instruments, not the fare.\n\nOpen questions for the reviewer: (1) obtain or restore the trip's GPS trace and chat export and run POL-NS-01(b)-(c) and POL-NS-04(a) on them; (2) whether the two registered pickup points at this TRANSPORT_HUB mean the parties held different faces of the interchange — if so, POL-NS-03 governs, including the platform-funded 50% pin-ambiguity payment where neither party named a sub-location.\n\nNo referral is recorded, because no clause that produces one fires. POL-NS-05(ii) needs a trace that exists and shows no qualifying in-geofence fix, which we do not have; and the POL-NS-07 anti-farming check does not trip (3 no-show terminations against 107 completed trips, 2.8%, below both the count limb of 4 and the rate limb of 8%), so no compensation-withholding instruction arises. The driver's reference to the lifetime prior_no_show_flags counter is noted but not used: POL-GEN-01 makes that field context only."
